'''Vek Drow'''<ref name="Discord">{{WookDiscord|discordname=.holocronkeeper|name=Leland Chee|date=2025-04-01|messagelink=https://discord.com/channels/397848917036761090/492457166771322881/1356665374845829290|quote=For example, I decided that Vek Drow is an Ishi Tib in Return of the Jedi. Were they at Mos Eisley for the Boonta Eve race? Who knows. But at least that RotJ character has  a name.|archivefile=File:LelandChee-VekDrow1-Discord.png}}</reF> was an [[Ishi Tib]] member of the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]] during the [[Galactic Civil War]] against the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="ROTJ" /> In [[4 ABY]],<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates the events of [[Star Wars: Episode VI Return of the Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VI ''Return of the Jedi'']] to [[4 ABY]].</ref> Drow attended a briefing on board<ref name="ROTJ" /> the [[flagship]] of the [[Rebel Alliance Navy|Alliance Fleet]], ''[[Home One]]'',<ref name="CGttSWG">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref>  where members of the [[Alliance High Command|Alliance leadership]], including [[Admiral]] [[Gial Ackbar]], [[Mon Mothma]], and [[General]] [[Crix Madine]], gave a briefing to the assembled rebels on their plans to [[Battle of Endor|attack]] the Empire's [[DS-2 Death Star II Mobile Battle Station|Death Star II]] [[superweapon]] in the [[Endor system]].<ref name="ROTJ" />

During the briefing, Drow stood at the rear of a group of three other Ishi Tib on the upper level of the [[Starship|flagship's]] briefing room. The ''Home One'' took part in the attack soon after the briefing and the rebels succeeded in destroying the [[Death Star]]. Drow had [[Color|green]] skin and wore a red [[Clothing|tunic]] with blue shoulderguards over a white shirt at the briefing.<ref name="ROTJ" />

==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|For example, I decided that Vek Drow is an Ishi Tib in Return of the Jedi. Were they at Mos Eisley for the Boonta Eve race? Who knows. But at least that RotJ character has  a name.|Leland Chee|<ref name="Discord" />}}
Vek Drow was created for the [[1983]] [[original trilogy]] film, [[Star Wars: Episode VI Return of the Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VI ''Return of the Jedi'']].<ref name="ROTJ" /> The briefing room scene was filmed on Stage 5 at [[Elstree Studios]] between [[February 12]] and [[February 25]] in [[1982]].<ref name="MakingOf">''[[The Making of Return of the Jedi]]''</ref> [[Holocron continuity database]] manager [[Leland Chee]] identified the Ishi Tib seen in ''Return of the Jedi'' as Vek Drow,<ref name="Discord" /><ref name="Position">{{WookDiscord|discordname=.holocronkeeper|name=Leland Chee|date=2025-04-01|messagelink=https://discord.com/channels/397848917036761090/492457166771322881/1356706011792281733|quote=Vek Drow is the Ishi Tib behind the other three.|archivefile=File:LelandChee-VekDrow2-Discord.png}}</reF> a name that originated in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity in the [[1999]] [[Star Wars: Episode I The Phantom Menace (video game)|video game adaptation]] of [[Star Wars: Episode I The Phantom Menace|''Star Wars'': Episode I ''The Phantom Menace'']]. In the [[Star Wars video games|video game]], Drow was an [[Ishi Tib/Legends|Ishi Tib]] wearing<ref name="TPMVG">[[Star Wars: Episode I The Phantom Menace (video game)|''Star Wars'': Episode I ''The Phantom Menace'' video game]]</ref> the same [[Clothing/Legends|outfit]] as the ''Return of the Jedi'' character<ref name="ROTJ" /> but present in [[Mos Espa/Legends|Mos Espa]] [[Spaceport/Legends|spaceport]] on the [[Planet/Legends|planet]] [[Tatooine/Legends|Tatooine]] during the [[Boonta Eve Classic/Legends|Boonta Eve Classic]]<ref name="TPMVG" /> in [[32 BBY/Legends|32 BBY]].<ref name="TPMDate">''[[The New Essential Chronology]]'' dates the events of [[Star Wars: Episode I The Phantom Menace (video game)|''Star Wars'': Episode I ''The Phantom Menace'' video game]] to [[32 BBY/Legends|32 BBY]].</ref> Chee has stated that it is unclear if Drow was canonically present during the race.<ref name="Discord" />

